# Direct dependencies with the ranges we support. requirements.txt is the locked set built from
# these (exact versions of everything, transitive included) and is what the image installs.
# To upgrade: edit a range here, install into a clean venv, run the tests, then
#   .venv/bin/pip freeze --exclude-editable > requirements.txt
# Python 3.14 (local and in the Docker image).

